      ],
      "source": "https://www.montgomeryil.org/198/Historic-Preservation",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Montgomery’s early industry included a stationary engine factory and a stone grain mill known as the Gray–Watkins Mill, both founded by Daniel Gray.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
